<title>USA: Code-Alarm names Craig Camalo CFO.</title>
<headline>Code-Alarm names Craig Camalo CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON HEIGHTS, Mich. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Code-Alarm Inc said Monday Craig S. Camalo has been appointed chief financial officer, replacing Robert Wagner, who retired.</p>
<p>Camalo joined the company in April 1996 as corporate controller, Code-Alarm noted.</p>
<p>The company said it recently hired James B. McNamara as assistant corporate controller. Previously he had been chief financial officer of KSR Group of Cos.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
